<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>LAMBODARA - Eco Ganesh Idols</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #e2f9e1, #c0e6ff);
    margin: 0;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  header {
    background: #2e8b57;
    color: white;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #26734d;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
    display: block;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  nav a:hover {
    background: #1f5f3e;
  }
  section {
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #2e8b57;
    border-left: 5px solid #2e8b57;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }
  .idol-gallery img {
    width: 180px;
    height: 220px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin: 10px;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .idol-gallery img:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  .card {
    background: white;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  label {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  input, select, textarea {
    padding: 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }
  button {
    background: #2e8b57;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover {
    background: #256f48;
  }
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #2e8b57;
    color: white;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>LAMBODARA - Eco Ganesh Idol Initiative</header>
<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#order">Order Idols</a>
  <a href="#ingredients">Ingredients</a>
  <a href="#watercredits">Water Credits</a>
  <a href="#colors">Natural Colors</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="home">
  <h2>Welcome to LAMBODARA</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p>
      <b>LAMBODARA</b> is an eco-conscious initiative that replaces traditional POP idols with
      3D printed clay idols enriched with eco-seeds and natural minerals. Our mission is to
      protect aquatic life, rejuvenate rivers, and promote sustainability during festive seasons.
    </p>
    <div class="idol-gallery">
      <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.SIYlW88VL2yvuAaRGy5AJQHaJ4?w=202&h=269&c=7&r=0&o=7&dpr=1.5&pid=1.7&rm=3" alt="3D Printed Eco Idol">
      <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.ERT1VX64E977NGGlpaJ7rwHaJ3?w=202&h=269&c=7&r=0&o=7&dpr=1.5&pid=1.7&rm=3">
      <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.dVaJ20zVqMuZADD9q0bDiwAAAA?w=202&h=270&c=7&r=0&o=7&dpr=1.5&pid=1.7&rm=3">
      <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.Kk-dyYBehUQj_ywO8An82wHaL4?w=197&h=316&c=7&r=0&o=7&dpr=1.5&pid=1.7&rm=3">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="order">
  <h2>Order Your Idol</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <form>
      <label for="name">Full Name</label>
      <input id="name" type="text" required placeholder="Your name" />
      <label for="size">Idol Height (4 to 25 feet)</label>
      <select id="size" required>
        <option>4 Feet</option>
        <option>6 Feet</option>
        <option>8 Feet</option>
        <option>12 Feet</option>
        <option>18 Feet</option>
        <option>25 Feet</option>
      </select>
      <label for="material">Material Type</label>
      <select id="material" required>
        <option>Eco Clay</option>
        <option>Recycled Clay + Seeds</option>
        <option>Lightweight 3D Clay Composite</option>
      </select>
      <label for="message">Customization Details</label>
      <textarea id="message" rows="3" placeholder="Describe your design preferences..."></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Submit Order</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ingredients">
  <h2>Eco Ingredients</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ul>
      <li>🌿 <b>Natural Clay</b> – 100% biodegradable and water-friendly</li>
      <li>🌱 <b>Seed Mix</b> – Grows aquatic plants after immersion</li>
      <li>🪨 <b>Mineral Additives</b> – Improves water quality</li>
      <li>🎨 <b>Natural Colors</b> – Plant-based dyes safe for rivers</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="watercredits">
  <h2>Water Credits</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p>
      <b>Water Credits</b> are rewards earned by contributing to clean water projects.
      Each LAMBODARA idol release enriches the water with beneficial minerals and aquatic seeds,
      allowing users to gain credits that represent measurable water quality impact.
    </p>
    <button onclick="alert('Water Credit Portal Coming Soon!')">Open Water Credit Dashboard</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="colors">
  <h2>Natural Colors Store</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p>
      We also produce and sell <b>natural plant-based colors</b> extracted from organic materials.
      These can be used for idol decoration, art, or eco-festivals.
    </p>
    <button onclick="alert('Natural Colors Marketplace Coming Soon!')">View Colors</button>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <form>
      <label for="email">Email</label>
      <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
      <label for="msg">Message</label>
      <textarea id="msg" rows="3" placeholder="Your message..."></textarea>
      <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2025 LAMBODARA | Hackverse 1.0 Project | Team Entrepreneurs
</footer>

<script>
  // Smooth scrolling
  document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(link => {
    link.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const section = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href'));
      section.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
